<script setup lang="ts">import { ref } from 'vue';import { useWorkspaceStore } from '../stores/workspace';import type { Currency } from '../api/types';const workspace=useWorkspaceStore();const name=ref(''),description=ref(''),currency=ref<Currency>('TWD'),color=ref('#7357ff');async function submit(){await workspace.createGroup({name:name.value,description:description.value,currency:currency.value,color:color.value});name.value='';description.value=''}</script>
<template><section class="page"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">GROUPS</p><h1>群組空間</h1><p>不同家庭、旅程或團隊可以各自擁有獨立帳本。</p></div></div><div class="two-column"><div class="card"><h2>你的群組</h2><div class="group-grid"><button v-for="group in workspace.groups" :key="group.id" class="group-tile" :class="{selected:group.id===workspace.currentGroupId}" @click="workspace.selectGroup(group.id)"><span class="group-color" :style="{background:group.color}"></span><strong>{{ group.name }}</strong><small>{{ group.currency }} · {{ group.description||'尚無說明' }}</small></button></div></div><form class="card form-card" @submit.prevent="submit"><h2>建立新群組</h2><label>群組名稱<input v-model="name" required maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：我們家"></label><label>簡短說明<textarea v-model="description" rows="3" placeholder="這個群組用來管理…"></textarea></label><div class="form-row"><label>幣別<select v-model="currency"><option>TWD</option><option>USD</option><option>JPY</option><option>EUR</option></select></label><label>代表色<input v-model="color" type="color"></label></div><button class="primary">建立群組</button></form></div></section></template>
